@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  ArrowColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #D7EAF8
  StartColor #334155
  EndColor #334155
}

state Starting #D7EAF8
state Ready #BEE5CF
state Stopping #FFF0A8
state Failed #F7C7C7

[*] --> Starting
Starting : isReady = false
Starting : parent owns every critical child
Starting --> Ready : initialization complete\nand required children ready

Ready : isReady = true
Ready : validator implies proposer alive\nand request queue open

Ready --> Stopping : operator / signal shutdown
Stopping : publish planned cancellation
Stopping : isReady = false
Stopping --> [*] : bounded clean shutdown

Starting --> Failed : critical child completes unexpectedly
Ready --> Failed : critical child returns, errors,\npanics, or loses owned channel
Failed : atomically set isReady = false
Failed : record bounded diagnostic + metric
Failed : cancel sibling tasks
Failed --> [*] : nonzero process exit

note right of Failed #E3D8F5
  The service manager restarts the
  complete process from durable state.
  No in-process proposer epoch split.
end note
@enduml
